# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Inventory Optimization: ABC-XYZ Analysis & Inventory Policy Simulator
# .gitignore
#
# Principle: the repository ships the MODEL and the DOCUMENTATION, not the
# 46 MB source dataset and not the tool cache. Anyone can rebuild the clean
# layer from data/raw/README.md plus powerquery/power_query_steps.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Source dataset (download separately - see data/raw/README.md) ----------
data/raw/*.xlsx
data/raw/*.xls
data/raw/*.csv
data/raw/*.zip
!data/raw/README.md

# --- Power BI ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.pbix.bak
*.pbit.bak
*.pbiviz
.pbi/
.pbi/localSettings.json
.pbi/cache.abf
*.abf
**/.pbi/
**/*.SemanticModel/.pbi/
**/*.Report/.pbi/
**/cache.abf
**/localSettings.json
AnalysisServicesWorkspace*/
*.tmp.pbix
# Power BI Desktop autorecovery
*.pbiat

# --- Excel ------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*.xlsx
~$*.xlsm
~$*.xls
~$*.docx
~$*.pptx
*.xlk
*.xlsb.bak
# Excel autorecover / temp
*.tmp
*.laccdb

# --- Dataset exports and working extracts -----------------------------------
*_export.csv
*_extract.csv
*_backup.xlsx
exports/
scratch/
temp/
# Keep the published clean layer
!data/clean/weekly_demand_long.csv
!data/clean/weekly_demand_wide.xlsx

# --- Archives ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.gz

# --- Operating system -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- VS Code ----------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace
.history/

# --- Python (tooling only - no Python is used in any deliverable) -----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# --- Credentials ------------------------------------------------------------
*.env
.env.*
credentials.json
connection_strings.txt
